द्वितीय पैराग्राफ (Microsoft Excel is used…) को Dashed अंडरलाइन दीजिए।","marks":1.66,"criteria":[{"rule":"words","kind":"body","place":1,"props":{"underline":[true],"underlineStyle":["dashed"]}}],"solution":"1. दूसरा पैराग्राफ सेलेक्ट करें।\n2. HOME → **Underline ▾** → **डैश लाइन (- - -)**।\n\nजाँच: पैराग्राफ के नीचे डैश वाली लाइन।"},{"number":4,"instruction":"तृतीय पैराग्राफ (This paragraph was indented…) का इंडेंट Decrease Indent से हटाइए।","marks":1.66,"criteria":[{"rule":"value","kind":"body","place":2,"target":"blocks.0.attrs.marginLeft","spec":{"regex":"^(0|0pt|0in|0px|0cm|0mm)$"}}],"solution":"1. तीसरे पैराग्राफ में क्लिक करें।\n2. HOME → **Decrease Indent** (जब तक पैराग्राफ बाएँ किनारे पर न आ जाए)।\n\nजाँच: तीसरा पैराग्राफ बाकी पैराग्राफ की सीध में।"},{"number":5,"instruction":"दी गई सूची (Excel, Word…) की बुलेट्स को Diamond (◆) बुलेट में बदलिए।","marks":1.66,"criteria":[{"rule":"value","kind":"body","place":4,"target":"blocks.0.attrs.listStyle","spec":["bullet-diamond"]},{"rule":"value","kind":"body","place":5,"target":"blocks.0.attrs.listStyle","spec":["bullet-diamond"]},{"rule":"value","kind":"body","place":6,"target":"blocks.0.attrs.listStyle","spec":["bullet-diamond"]},{"rule":"value","kind":"body","place":7,"target":"blocks.0.attrs.listStyle","spec":["bullet-diamond"]}],"solution":"1. सूची के चारों आइटम सेलेक्ट करें।\n2. HOME → **Bullets ▾** → **◆ Diamond bullets**।\n\nजाँच: चारों आइटम के आगे ◆।"},{"number":6,"instruction":"सूची के आइटम को Sort से Z से A (Descending) क्रम में लगाइए।","marks":1.66,"criteria":[{"rule":"text","kind":"body","place":4,"find":"Word"},{"rule":"text","kind":"body","place":5,"find":"PowerPoint"},{"rule":"text","kind":"body","place":6,"find":"Excel"},{"rule":"text","kind":"body","place":7,"find":"Access"}],"solution":"1. सूची के चारों आइटम सेलेक्ट करें।\n2. HOME → **Sort (A↓Z)** → **Descending** → **Apply** (MS Word में: Sort by **Paragraphs**, Type **Text**, **Descending** → **OK**)।\n\nजाँच: क्रम Word, PowerPoint, Excel, Access।"},{"number":7,"instruction":"Page Number → Bottom of Page → \"Page X of Y\" (फूटर के बीच में \"Page 1 of 1\") लगाइए।","marks":1.66,"criteria":[{"rule":"run","kind":"footer","props":{"field":{"regex":"^page-number\\|bottom\\|center"},"text":{"regex":"page\\s*\\d+\\s*of\\s*\\d+"}}}],"solution":"1. INSERT → **Page Number ▾** → **Bottom of Page** → **Page X of Y**।\n2. **Close Header and Footer**।\n\nजाँच: फूटर के बीच में \"Page 1 of 1\"।"},{"number":8,"instruction":"टेबल की हेडिंग रो (S.No., Name, Marks) का Text Direction बदलकर टेक्स्ट को ऊपर से नीचे (Rotate 90°) कीजिए।","marks":1.66,"criteria":[{"rule":"table","place":0,"onlyRow":0,"cellProps":{"textDirection":{"regex":"^(down|up)$"}}}],"solution":"1. टेबल की पहली रो सेलेक्ट करें।\n2. TABLE TOOLS → **LAYOUT** → **Text Direction** (एक बार)।\n\nजाँच: हेडिंग के शब्द खड़े (ऊपर से नीचे)।"},{"number":9,"instruction":"टेबल की Total रो के Marks सेल में Formula =SUM(ABOVE) लगाइए।","marks":1.66,"criteria":[{"rule":"value","kind":"body","place":10,"target":"blocks.0.attrs.rows.4.2","spec":{"regex":"^\\s*125(\\.0+)?\\s*$"}}],"solution":"1. Total रो के Marks वाले खाली सेल में क्लिक करें।\n2. TABLE TOOLS → **LAYOUT** → **Formula (fx)** → **=SUM(ABOVE)** → **OK**।\n\nजाँच: सेल में 125।"},{"number":10,"instruction":"टेबल के Cell Margins (Default cell margins) में Left एवं Right 0.5 cm कीजिए।","marks":1.66,"criteria":[{"rule":"table","place":0,"attrs":{"cellMarginLeft":[0.5],"cellMarginRight":[0.5]}}],"solution":"1. टेबल में क्लिक करें।\n2. TABLE TOOLS → **LAYOUT** → **Cell Margins** → Left **0.5 cm**, Right **0.5 cm** → **OK**।\n\nजाँच: सेल के अंदर टेक्स्ट किनारे से ज़्यादा दूर।"},{"number":11,"instruction":"टेबल पर Table Style \"List Table 3 - Accent 1\" लगाइए।","marks":1.66,"criteria":[{"rule":"table","place":0,"attrs":{"tableStyle":["list-3-accent-1"]}}],"solution":"1. टेबल में क्लिक करें।\n2. TABLE TOOLS → **DESIGN** → Table Styles ▾ → List Tables में **List Table 3 - Accent 1**।\n\nजाँच: नीली हेडिंग रो और नीली बाहरी लाइन।"},{"number":12,"instruction":"Custom Watermark में Text \"SCTyping\" लिखकर Layout Horizontal कीजिए।","marks":1.66,"criteria":[{"rule":"value","target":"pageLayout.watermark","spec":{"regex":"^\\s*sctyping\\s*$"}},{"rule":"value","target":"pageLayout.watermarkLayout","spec":["horizontal"]}],"solution":"1. DESIGN → **Watermark ▾** → **Custom Watermark…**।\n2. **Text watermark** → Text **SCTyping** → Layout **Horizontal** → **OK**।\n\nजाँच: पेज के बीच में सीधा (आड़ा नहीं) वाटरमार्क।"},{"number":13,"instruction":"पूरे डॉक्यूमेंट को Three कॉलम (Columns) में कीजिए।","marks":1.66,"criteria":[{"rule":"value","target":"pageLayout.columnCount","spec":["3",3]}],"solution":"1. PAGE LAYOUT → **Columns ▾** → **Three**।\n\nजाँच: टेक्स्ट तीन कॉलम में।"},{"number":14,"instruction":"पेज के Margins \"Office 2003 Default\" कीजिए।","marks":1.66,"criteria":[{"rule":"value","target":"pageLayout.padding","spec":{"regex":"^25\\.4mm 31\\.8mm 25\\.4mm 31\\.8mm$"}}],"solution":"1. PAGE LAYOUT → **Margins ▾** → **Office 2003 Default** (Left/Right 3.18 cm)।\n\nजाँच: बाएँ-दाएँ मार्जिन 3.18 cm।"},{"number":15,"instruction":"पेज का Size B5 (JIS) कीजिए।","marks":1.76,"criteria":[{"rule":"value","target":"pageLayout.aspectRatio","spec":{"regex":"^18\\.2 ?/ ?25\\.7$"}}],"solution":"1. PAGE LAYOUT → **Size ▾** → **B5 (JIS)** (18.2 cm × 25.7 cm)।\n\nजाँच: पेज छोटा B5 साइज़ का।"}]$q$::jsonb, $q${"schemaVersion":"2","blocks":[{"id":"block-0","type":"paragraph","alignment":"justify","runs":[{"text":"jktLFkku deZpkjh p;u cksMZ gj o\"kZ fyfid vkSj lgk;d inksa ds fy, ijh{kk vk;ksftr djrk gSA bl ijh{kk esa Vkbfiax dh xfr ds lkFk dEI;wVj n{krk dh Hkh tk¡p gksrh gSA vH;FkhZ dks fu/kkZfjr le; esa MkWD;wesaV dks lgh QkWesZV esa rS;kj djuk gksrk gSA","bold":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"underlineStyle":null,"underlineColor":null,"underlineThickness":null,"underlineWordsOnly":false,"strike":false,"doubleStrike":false,"superscript":false,"subscript":false,"smallCaps":false,"allCaps":false,"hidden":false,"outli